# Usage instructions:

## 1. Build for multiple architectures using Docker buildx:

`docker buildx create --name mybuilder --use`

`docker buildx inspect --bootstrap`

`docker buildx build --platform linux/amd64,linux/arm64 \
     -t yourname/yourapp:latest \
     --push .`

## 2. Or build for a single architecture:
### For AMD64
`docker build --build-arg TARGETARCH=amd64 -t yourname/yourapp:amd64 .`

### For ARM64
`docker build --build-arg TARGETARCH=arm64 -t yourname/yourapp:arm64 .`